diff --git a/chrome/app/theme/simprint/win/README b/chrome/app/theme/simprint/win/README
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/chrome/app/theme/simprint/win/README
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+Place Simprint Windows icons here. Required when is_simprint_branded = true.
+
+  simprint.ico     - Main app icon (required)
+  app_list.ico     - App list
+  incognito.ico    - Incognito
+  simprint_doc.ico - HTML document
+  simprint_pdf.ico - PDF document
+
+For a quick test, copy from chromium: e.g. cp ../chromium/win/chromium.ico simprint.ico (and similarly for others).
